Key Findings
Initial Access

Affected component: Outdated Drupal installation
Impact: Remote code execution in the vulnerable lab environment
Result: Initial shell as the low-privileged www-data user.

Privilege Escalation

Affected component: Misconfigured SUID permissions on the find binary
Impact: Local privilege escalation
Result: Root-level access to the system.
